  "solution": "**Given:**\n\ndfrac{(2.31× 2.31+2× 2.31× 1.69+1.69× 1.69)}{(2.31+1.69)}\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + 2ab + b²\n\n**Calculation:**\n\ndfrac{(2.31× 2.31+2× 2.31× 1.69+1.69× 1.69)}{(2.31+1.69)}\n\n⇒ Numerator = (2.31)² + 2(2.31)(1.69) + (1.69)²\n\n⇒ Numerator = (2.31 + 1.69)²\n\n⇒ Expression = dfrac{(2.31 + 1.69)²}{(2.31 + 1.69)}\n\n⇒ Expression = (2.31 + 1.69)\n\n⇒ Expression = 4.00\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**\n\n48:T52a,",
